Payload: &#60;script&#62;alert('XSS')&#60;/script&#62;

When the filter is bypassed, the server responds with the success message 'Let the game begin. Good Luck' (new_umbrella.png) instead of 'Failed! Try again!' (error_umbrella.png), confirming the XSS payload was accepted.

The flag format is flag{UUID} and is revealed when the XSS payload alert('XSS') executes successfully in a browser context.

